# VERITO Evidence Collector Agent — Full Implementation Plan

## Overview

Rebuild the Evidence Collector Agent pipeline with the correct file architecture, proper parsers, EasyOCR + Qwen2.5-VL vision, BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 embeddings, and Qdrant Cloud vector store — replacing Chroma and pytesseract/all-MiniLM-L6-v2.

