### Component 2 — Parsers (all NEW files under `app/parsers/`)

#### [NEW] `app/parsers/pdf_parser.py`
- PyMuPDF extracts text from digital PDFs
- **Fallback**: if a page has no text, converts page → PIL Image → EasyOCR
- Returns combined page-by-page text

#### [NEW] `app/parsers/image_parser.py`
- Calls `ocr_service.extract_text()` for OCR text (EasyOCR)
- Calls `caption_service.describe_image()` for AI scene description (Qwen2.5-VL)
- Combines both into structured output: `OCR TEXT:\n...\n\nIMAGE DESCRIPTION:\n...`

#### [NEW] `app/parsers/email_parser.py`
- Python `email` stdlib, handles multipart
- Extracts: From, To, Subject, Date, body text

#### [NEW] `app/parsers/chat_parser.py`
- Handles `.txt` chat logs and `.json` structured chat exports
- Formats as `[Timestamp] Sender: Message`

#### [NEW] `app/parsers/csv_parser.py`
- Python `csv` stdlib
- Row-by-row extraction with header labels

#### [NEW] `app/parsers/docx_parser.py`
- `python-docx`: paragraphs + tables extracted

#### [NEW] `app/parsers/__init__.py`

---

### Component 3 — Services (new/replaced under `app/services/`)

#### [NEW] `app/services/ocr_service.py`
- EasyOCR reader (lazy-loaded, singleton per language set)
- `extract_text(image_bytes) → str`
- Supports: `en` language by default

#### [NEW] `app/services/caption_service.py`
- Qwen2.5-VL via `transformers` (lazy-loaded)
- `describe_image(image_bytes, filename) → str`
- Generates scene-level description from image

#### [NEW] `app/services/text_cleaner.py`
- Evidence-preserving cleaner (no stemming/stop-word removal)
- Normalises whitespace, removes control chars
- Preserves IDs, dates, numbers, names

#### [NEW] `app/services/chunking_service.py`
- Sliding-window chunker: `chunk_size=512`, `overlap=64` (chars)
- Returns `list[str]`

#### [REPLACE] [embedding_service.py](file:///d:/VERITO/backend/app/services/embedding_service.py)
- Replace `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` with `BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5`
- `EMBEDDING_DIMENSION = 384` stays (same dim for bge-small)
- Keeps `embed_texts()`, `embed_query()` API identical

#### [NEW] `app/services/vector_store.py`
- Qdrant Cloud client (lazy singleton)
- `store_evidence_chunks(text, user_id, investigation_id, evidence_id, filename) → int`
- `query_evidence(query, investigation_id, n_results) → list[dict]`
- `delete_investigation_chunks(investigation_id) → None`
- Collection: `QDRANT_COLLECTION` from settings (auto-created if not exists)
- Distance: `COSINE`

#### [DELETE] `app/services/chroma_service.py`
#### [DELETE] `app/services/image_service.py` (replaced by parsers/image_parser.py + ocr_service + caption_service)
#### [DELETE] `app/services/document_parser.py` (replaced by parsers/)

