### Component 4 — Evidence Collector Agent

#### [REPLACE] [evidence_collector.py](file:///d:/VERITO/backend/app/agents/evidence_collector.py)
Full pipeline:
1. Fetch evidence docs for investigation from MongoDB
2. For each file: read bytes from disk → dispatch to correct parser
3. Clean text → chunk → embed → upsert to Qdrant Cloud
4. Emit SSE activity lines per step
5. Update agent_run document in MongoDB on completion

