## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
cd backend
pytest tests/test_qdrant.py -v
pytest tests/test_embedding.py -v
pytest tests/test_parsers.py -v
```

### Manual Verification
- Upload a digital PDF → verify text extracted by PyMuPDF
- Upload a scanned PDF image → verify EasyOCR fallback kicks in
- Upload a JPEG → verify OCR text + AI scene description combined
- Upload CSV, DOCX, .eml → verify clean text extraction
- Check Qdrant Cloud dashboard for stored vectors
- Run existing `/api/evidence/upload/` endpoint to confirm backward compatibility

---

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Qwen2.5-VL Model Size**: This is a multi-billion parameter vision LLM. First-time load will download several GB. It will be lazy-loaded (only when an image is processed). On machines without a GPU, inference will be slow — this is expected.

> [!NOTE]
> **No breaking changes to other agents**: `evidence_analyzer.py`, `evidence_linker.py`, `timeline_builder.py`, `report_generator.py`, `subject_analyzer.py` and all API routes except `evidence_service.py` are untouched.
